WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:10.240
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:28.080
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:37.760
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:42.460
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.400
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:53.380
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:59.080
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:04.760
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.400
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:14.230
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:19.200
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:29.010
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.750
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:40.250
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.160
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.290
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.
This is the brokerage note
from a few days ago.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.870
This one is the details of payment...

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:49.400
...and this is The Association
registration certificate.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.200
Indeed.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:02.180
Things have changed, even here...

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:02.820
Hm?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.580
No, it's nothing.

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.390
By the way, where's your president?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.020
He's at a mountain retreat today.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.350
A mountain retreat, you say?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.390
It's snowing.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.510
A butterfly? When it's this cold?

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.080
Its wing is hurt?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.520
Come on. You're going to tear that wing apart.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.060
Come on, please...

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.790
Don't be scared-

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.330
Wait!

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.030
Wait!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.270
Spell wave contamination?!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:15.120
This is... magic?

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:16.550
But whose?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.590
Can't go to sleep...

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.260
Can't go to sleep!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.510
Episode 16
THE RED SPEAR

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.640
No! Don't use that eye!

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.520
Om sendara harabaya sowaka!

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:07.260
Hey, boy! Are you okay! Hey!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:14.910
An evil spirit known as a "larva."

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.980
It gives a person nightmares.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.180
Before long, they become obsessed
with the nightmare and become its prey.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:23.920
Take that!

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.530
And that! And that!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:27.890
And that!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.370
What's wrong?

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:33.800
Aren't you going to struggle a bit more,

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.100
like the wounded beast you are?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.070
Naumaku samamanda, basara...

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:42.730
Dan kan!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.070
Behind you!

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.760
Damn... It fled.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.730
What are you, boy?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.500
W-What am I?

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.270
You saw an evil spirit,

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:19.010
which would be invisible to a normal person.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.280
You don't seem like one, but are you a mage?

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:28.720
Boy!

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:33.160
Give me an answer that satisfies me,

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.860
or else I may have to get rough with you!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.600
Um, uh, well, I...

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.230
I was just chasing the butterfly, when...

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.330
The butterfly?

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:43.900
Yeah.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.340
It looked like its wing was hurt,

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:51.180
so I was chasing after it to see if I could do
something for it and went into this tunnel.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.580
And then, suddenly, I fell asleep.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.580
You're not buying this story, are you?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.780
Oh, is that what happened?!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:04.790
Sorry!

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.620
You were trying to help a butterfly!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.160
What a kind nature you have!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.900
To have mistreated someone so kindly natured,
a rare trait in this day and age...

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:18.430
I, Sekiren, have committed the
greatest blunder of my life!

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.680
If it will make up for it,

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.700
I shall cut open my own belly to atone!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.840
No! You don't need to commit seppuku!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.050
No, only that can make up
for my hasty judgment!

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:34.140
No! No! The thought enough is fine!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:36.160
Just the thought, okay?!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:39.020
Oh, wait. There is that.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.360
Hang on, where did I put them?

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.130
I should have one left...

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.030
Ah! Here we go!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.170
Please take this.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.970
I'm but a humble monk who
works for this company.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.280
If you have any problems,

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.880
I think we can offer all sorts of advice for you.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.340
Mr. Sekiren... of Astral?!

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.980
Yup! I'm a contract worker.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:09.120
Um, actually... I kinda work for Astral, too...

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.220
What? You work for Astral too, Boy?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.830
Y... You mean, you're?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.590
YOU'RE?!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:19.730
Young Master.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:21.790
Young Master?!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:25.970
Here you go.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.670
Thank you.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:31.300
The herbal tea you make is superb, Kuroha.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:35.280
The president must miss not having it to drink.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.220
So, what is Sekiren like?

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.280
How do I put this?

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.590
He's a person with many unusual traits.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:53.330
True, the previous generation of Astral
members were all a bit odd in their own ways,

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:59.070
but he's a bit of an oddball among oddballs.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.110
An oddball among oddballs?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.940
In a word, he's a nice guy.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.910
He lives, going from journey to journey.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.440
Once in a while, he comes back here.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.650
This time, he was off wandering around Europe.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:23.730
But why would Itsuki suddenly decide
to stay with Sekiren to train?

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.600
Lately, Brother Pres has
been training on his own.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.000
Running in the mountains and stuff like that.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:35.510
The president has asked Sekiren
to instruct him in martial arts.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:39.010
He's definitely the one to go to for that.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:44.280
In a way, the martial arts are the most
practical form of magic there is.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:53.890
Young Master!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.060
Keep your eyes open and
don't move even a single step!

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.130
Icchan-

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:06.400
Ah, Miss Honami!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:08.510
Honami.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.770
Um, I came to bring you this.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:11.840
A box lunch?

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.540
Kuroha made it, so I came to give it to you...

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.280
Nevermind that.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.120
Haven't you been here a while now?

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:22.010
Oh... I try to come back every so often, but...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.030
Since you haven't been coming in,

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.960
the office and paperwork are just piling up.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.590
Not to mention the magic textbooks
I have ready for you that are getting dusty.

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.400
You're still inexperienced, Young Master?

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.500
No, he hasn't studied nearly enough!

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:40.100
About magic or running a business.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.540
It's not so much him being inexperienced
as it is him being like an infant!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.110
I can see what you mean.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.050
Does he have any talent for this?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.140
No.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:53.450
Since he doesn't, I'm just trying to
get his eyes used to this for now.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.050
Move and you'll get hit!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.390
Hang in there, Boss.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:01.860
Huh?!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.360
Young Master...

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:13.540
Suzaku, Genbu, Byakko, Seiryu...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.170
Oh, well. Shall we go back to our room, then?

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.510
Where did you come in from?

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:23.980
I am still an employee here.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.520
I have 3 or 4 duplicate passkeys to this place.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:30.550
Well, you could get in with or without a key.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.760
You're practically calling me a thief!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:37.060
When did you start talking like that?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.630
Nevermind that, where is our president?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.860
He passed out.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.240
I've got some time before he wakes up,

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.830
so I've come down from the mountain for a visit.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.840
Please take it easy with him.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.200
Of course.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.380
I'm still introducing myself to him.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:56.940
Anyway, Ren...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.280
About the matter at hand.

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.590
Could you maybe leave this to me to handle?

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.390
What?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.460
Good grief!

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.610
What am I, a monster?

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.400
Oh, Sekiren.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.840
Is it night already?

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.770
Indeed. For a while now.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.640
Now then, how about it?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:34.810
I've been instructing you
for two weeks, as you asked.

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:38.390
Do you have any thoughts about it yet?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.250
Umm...

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.270
Did you imagine that martial arts training
would be like it is in the movies,

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:47.330
with me having you do various katas and such?

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.440
Um, no. Well...

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.840
That's not wrong, exactly,

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.640
but it's only one side of the process.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.240
In your condition,

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:00.180
it'd be meaningless to tell you to do 10,000
push-ups or to break roof tiles in half, wouldn't it?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:03.350
Well... Yeah, I guess...

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:06.280
Martial arts are just one of
the magical arts, you know.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:07.650
It's magic?

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.480
The eight signs of the "Eight Trigrams Palm,"

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.730
the five elements of the
"Five Elements Fist," and more...

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.520
...are based on Chinese magical theory.

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.100
Even in Japan,

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:20.930
there are many martial arts based on magic,
like Hayashizaki Musou Ryu and others.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:23.690
Now then...

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.770
I have a small task to perform.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.240
I'll have to leave the temple for a few days.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.010
Huh?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:34.910
But I was ready to stay here, like you told me to.

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:38.250
And it shames me more than
I can stand to do this to you.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.280
I pray that you stay well, Young Master.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.890
Sekiren! Sekiren!

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.290
Itsuki!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:55.170
Honami told me how hard you're working,
so I brought you some of my herbal tea.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:57.230
Thanks.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.030
By the way, why the maid outfit today?

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.540
Does it look strange?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:07.740
There you go.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.010
Mm. Thanks.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:14.920
It's good!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.150
Itsuki, tell me...

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.450
Why are you trying to make yourself stronger?

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.630
I haven't really thought about it, have I?

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.630
This time, maybe it's...

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.330
Hm?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.570
Because I want to do something myself.

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:30.930
Look,

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:34.670
up till now I've just stumbled into things
and had to rely on others for help.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.310
So, I've never actually done anything on my own.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.250
I've tried training on my own,

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.150
but I haven't really gotten much better.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:49.010
So, when I met Sekiren, I figured
"If I learn from him, I can get stronger!"

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:51.420
That's what I thought, anyway...

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:52.890
I see.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.160
I just wanted to really try, just a bit,

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.400
because I've been relying
on everyone else up till now.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:02.000
I just want to return the favor,

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.370
even if it's only one, little thing I can do.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.540
I want to try hard so I can do
that as soon as possible.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.870
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.400
I'm rooting for you!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.150
Thanks!

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:17.480
Sure!

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:24.520
Itsuki!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:29.830
Itsuki!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.200
Over there...

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:44.910
Itsuki!

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.000
It isn't hot.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.710
Then this must be spell wave contamination!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:54.620
Hurry!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:59.050
Kuroha, get to Astral!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.130
Where's your cell phone?

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.820
You'd be faster! Tell the others!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:04.290
What about you?

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.530
I'll see what I can do in there.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.790
All right, I'll be right back!

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:18.500
Damn! I'm cut off!

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.020
Who's there?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.450
Itsuki Iba, I presume.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.970
Fragile stone!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.110
There we go.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.150
Kuroha!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.350
Honami! Thank goodness!

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.120
I was just coming to tell you!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.890
I had a bad feeling and
came here to check it out.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.050
What's up?

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:11.420
Did something happen?!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.830
It's terrible! Itsuki is!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:48.990
I could take it!

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.600
Did Sekiren's training work for me?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:52.840
In that case!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:56.640
You think I'm going to let you escape?

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.520
Are you finished fighting me?

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.420
Well, then...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.630
You shall die!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.460
Look! Look!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.830
You still haven't given up?

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.480
Release me!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.740
Release me!

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:33.970
I see...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.970
Look! Look!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:40.520
Release me and destroy his fragile magic!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.150
That's right!

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.250
I can't depend on this eye!

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:50.020
But if I don't, I won't survive!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:51.700
In that case...

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.130
I should compensate for it!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.960
What is it you learned?

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:57.500
What?

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.170
The larva!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:04.700
Then, this is...

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:08.480
This is a nightmare the larva is showing me!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.950
This world connects reality with dreams...

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.120
Which means, if I beat it here,

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.950
the larva in the real world
will also be beaten!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.490
In that case!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.560
I will...

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.840
I will give this all I've got...

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:31.940
...and beat you!

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:52.250
Boss! Boss! Boss!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.730
Thank goodness.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:03.600
Sekiren said you'd be all right,
but you weren't waking up.

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.910
You don't need martial arts training...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.340
...if you're just gonna make us worry all the time!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.440
Um, uh, well...

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.480
Young Master.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.550
Sekiren...

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:22.310
I think that was a little
cruel for a training exercise.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:23.920
Well done, Young Master.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.630
You figured it out?

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.320
What do you mean?

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.290
There was a larva nesting in that tunnel.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.590
A larva?!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.300
That must have been the one
Astral was hired to exterminate.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.400
The one we encountered here before,

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:41.330
but which escaped before I could finish it off.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:42.870
Of course,

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:47.940
because you need to exterminate it from
within the nightmare it gives you.

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:53.390
Sekiren intentionally caused
that spell wave contamination...

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.250
...to drive me into the tunnel.

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:58.090
Doing that drew the larva out.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:19:59.950
That's it, wasn't it?

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:05.260
I could exterminate the larva and
train you as well, Young Master.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.430
A convenient way to kill
two birds with one stone.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.570
Convenient, huh?

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.770
What if Itsuki had gotten hurt?

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:17.630
You could have at least let us help him!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.250
The president can't do
anything by himself, after all!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:25.380
That's right, this is the first case
the president's handled on his own.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.680
We came to see you!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:33.950
I wasn't sure myself when
Sekiren told me he wanted...

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.090
...to leave this completely to you, Mr. President.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.870
Still, they say the mightiest cats...

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:43.630
...train their young by throwing them
into valleys when they're newborn.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.000
That's lions, not cats.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:53.540
The young master was able to face this
on his own, without help from anyone.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.910
You did a fine job.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:58.610
Brother Pres, you're awesome!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.450
You understand now?

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.590
That I mustn't run from this eye, right?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.690
Right.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:11.490
You asked me to train you so
that you wouldn't use that eye.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:16.060
But no matter how you try,
that won't always work.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.760
You can't avoid using that eye!

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:23.210
And if you're impatient to learn how to fight,

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.680
the best you can hope for
is a smattering of knowledge.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.680
Better not to learn at all in that case!

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:31.740
Work with the eye, Young Master.

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:33.840
With the eye.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.350
Don't let it control you.

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.310
Fight together with it.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.690
Fight together...

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:43.730
Together...

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.880
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:16.290
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:29.340
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:41.250
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:47.520
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.030
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.900 --> 00:22:56.300
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.300 --> 00:23:01.400
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:13.280
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.320
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.560
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.530
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.030
Five Elements Fist [GOGYOKEN]

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:29.260
Five Elements Fist [GOGYOKEN]
Looks like you put in a lot
of work, Mr. President.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.340
It finally seems like I can handle this stuff.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.170
Still, a little knowledge can be dangerous.

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:34.140
Don't get careless now.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.840
I know. Thanks, Honami.

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:37.610
Prof. Miwa, do you have
any warnings for him too?

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:38.180
